WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.970
-It is time for
"Tonight Show Hashtags"!

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.106
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.678
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:14.781
-Oh, we do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.117
and ask you guys to
respond to that topic.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.985 line:0%
Since it looks like
the president will be

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.553 line:0%
moving out of
The White House soon,

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.755 line:0%
I sent out a hashtag called
#TimeToMove

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:24.256 line:0%
and I asked you guys to
tweet something

00:00:24.256 --> 00:00:27.260 line:0%
funny, weird, or embarrassing
about a place you used to live,

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.930 line:0%
something that happened that let
you know it was time to move.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.398
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic,

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:34.000
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.636
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:38.438
And now I thought I'd share some
of my favorite

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:41.007
#TimeToMove responses
from you guys.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.909
This first one is from
@SandieMoore.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.577
She says...

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:57.156
Yeah, time to move.
Everyone needs a hobby.

00:00:57.156 --> 00:01:01.027
This one is from @MettaJoelKatz.
He says...

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.340
You got to get one of those
Dirt Devils.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.343
Or one of those Dyson jawns.
-I don't know.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.912
The Dyson says
it never loses suction.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.549
-It doesn't.
-But I think it does.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.817
[ Imitates vacuum running ]

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.953
Which one was I doing?
Dirt Devil or Dyson?

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:28.755
-I don't know,
'cause your impression sucks.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.292
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:35.161
-What? That makes no sense.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.363
Oh, I got you.
-Yeah, man.

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:40.066
-Oh! Oh.
-Yeah.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.568
I just got it.
Yeah, wow, wow, wow.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:45.505
Any joke where you have to do
that afterwards...

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.874
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:51.945
And hold it?
That was awesome.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:55.047
This next one is from
@Real Danye West.

00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:57.817
Real Danye West.
You get it?

00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:06.826
-Not the imposter.
-No. This is Real Danye West.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.195
Oh, yeah. So, he says...

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.773
No. This one's from
@knockknock penny.

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:21.908
She says...

00:02:34.119 --> 00:02:36.723
♪ What's love ♪

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:38.491
[ Humming ]

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.260
Dude, did you say --
Who wrote "Private Dancer"?

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.495
You said somebody cool.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.864
-Dude from Dire Straits.
-Mark Knopfler.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:45.999
-Yeah.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.935
-My mom was into
that whole album,

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:51.003
and then that was the song
that kind of stuck out with her.

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:52.405
And she would do,
like, a good --

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:55.408
She would sing it, but not quite
knowing what it's about.

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:58.744
So we were kids going like,
"That's pretty good.

00:02:58.744 --> 00:03:01.814
And, like, this is --

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:05.417
You shouldn't sing
'Private Dancer' to us.

00:03:05.417 --> 00:03:06.552
You're saying you're..."

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:09.454
Eh, whatever.

00:03:09.454 --> 00:03:12.224
Any old music will do.

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:15.761
This one's from @lex 1110.

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:17.363
He says...

00:03:22.034 --> 00:03:23.936
"Bob, Emily,
quick house meeting?

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:26.673
What do you guys think?"

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.741
This last one is from
@caitlincarrickm.

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:29.909
She says...

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.714
There you go, everybody.

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:36.182
Those are
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:37.716 line:0%
To check out more of
our favorites,

00:03:37.716 --> 00:03:40.253 line:0%
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

